  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 8001.02 Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 8001.02 Scope.\n\n(a) These rules shall establish standards for the minimum requirements for education, field experience and testing for applicants seeking licensure to become a fuel gas fitter and business entities seeking licensure in the following categories:\n\n(1) Individuals or business entities engaged in the installation of residential and non-residential gas appliances and any other gas utilization equipment using liquefied propane gas or natural gas;\n\n(2) Individuals or business entities engaged in the servicing and repair of residential and non-residential gas appliances and any other gas utilization equipment using liquefied propane gas or natural gas;\n\n(3) Individuals or business entities engaged in the installation, servicing, or removal of gas piping for residential and non-residential gas appliances and any other gas utilization equipment using liquefied propane gas or natural gas and;\n\n(4) Individuals or business entities engaged in the installation, servicing or repair of hearth systems using liquefied propane gas or natural gas.\n\n(b) These rules shall not apply to anyone who:\n\n(1) Performs fuel gas fitting within an existing single family, stand alone structure owned or occupied by the person who is performing the fuel gas fitting work; or\n\n(2) Performs tasks covered by the federal and state regulation of public utilities, pursuant to RSA 153:36, II.\n\n(c) These rules shall not apply to anyone who:\n\n(1) Performs fuel gas fitting within an existing single family, stand alone structure owned or occupied by the person who is performing the fuel gas fitting work, and such structure is used as the individual’s primary residence; or\n\n(2) Performs tasks covered by the federal and state regulation of public utilities, pursuant to RSA 153:36, II.\n\nSource. #8954, eff 7-21-07; amd by #9542, eff 9-10-09",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c8000.html"
}
